---
// shipping.astro - WNCPARTSLINGERS Shipping & Handling Policy
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Shipping Policy | WNCPARTSLINGERS</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Shipping policy, handling times, carrier methods, and delivery estimates for WNCPARTSLINGERS warehouse orders in Hendersonville, NC." />
    <meta name="p:domain_verify" content="84b06eac7f89764d1148798575c74a4a" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" />
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header & Navigation -->
    <header class="navbar">
        <a href="/" class="logo">
            <span class="highlight">WNC</span>PARTSLINGERS
        </a>
        <nav>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="/#catalog">Catalog</a></li>
                <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="/shipping" class="active">Shipping</a></li>
                <li><a href="/returns">Returns</a></li>
                <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.ebay.com/str/wncpartslingers" target="_blank" rel="noopener">eBay Store</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
        <div class="nav-actions">
            <a href="https://www.ebay.com/str/wncpartslingers" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-store"></i> eBay Storefront
            </a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="pdp-container" style="max-width: 850px; padding: 40px 20px;">
        <span class="tagline">// LOGISTICS & DISPATCH</span>
        <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 8px;">Shipping & Handling Policy</h1>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 32px;">Warehouse Direct Fulfillment from Hendersonville, North Carolina (28792)</p>

        <div class="pdp-specs-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text-main);">1. Order Processing & Handling Time</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.7;">
                All verified orders are processed, packaged, and dispatched within <strong>1 business day (24 hours)</strong> of cleared payment, Monday through Friday.
            </p>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7;">
                Orders placed over the weekend or on postal holidays are securely packed and dispatched the following business morning.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pdp-specs-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text-main);">2. Carrier Options & Estimated Delivery Timelines</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.7;">
                We ship nationwide across the United States using tier-one commercial carrier services with end-to-end tracking:
            </p>
            <ul style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-left: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.8;">
                <li><strong>USPS Ground Advantage (Standard Delivery):</strong> Estimated delivery in <strong>2–5 business days</strong>. Includes live tracking.</li>
                <li><strong>USPS Priority Mail (Expedited Delivery):</strong> Estimated delivery in <strong>1–3 business days</strong>. Includes live tracking.</li>
                <li><strong>UPS Ground (Heavy & Bulky Assemblies):</strong> Estimated delivery in <strong>2–5 business days</strong>. Includes live tracking.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="pdp-specs-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text-main);">3. Combined Shipping & Multi-Item Orders</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7;">
                Combined shipping calculates automatically at checkout for all multi-item orders. Shipping costs are assessed strictly on cumulative packaged weight, ensuring fair rates with zero handling markup.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pdp-specs-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text-main);">4. Commercial Protective Packaging</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7;">
                Vintage hardware and New Old Stock (NOS) parts in historic manufacturer packaging receive reinforced protective materials. Every order is shipped in rigid corrugated boxes or padded bubble mailers with cushioning to safeguard against transit shock.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pdp-specs-box">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text-main);">5. Tracking Information & Delivery Notifications</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7;">
                A live carrier tracking number is generated immediately when your shipping label is printed and is transmitted directly to your order confirmation email and account dashboard.
            </p>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 WNCPARTSLINGERS. Built for automotive restorers and performance technicians. · <a href="/about">About Us</a> · <a href="/shipping">Shipping Policy</a> · <a href="/returns">Return Policy</a> · <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a> · <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a> · <a href="https://www.ebay.com/str/wncpartslingers" target="_blank" rel="noopener">eBay Store</a></p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
